---Line items that break down the invoice total. When provided, the sum of (quantity * unit_price) for all items must equal the plan price. Individual items may be negative to represent a credit, as long as the sum is not negative and clears the currency's minimum charge. Pass an empty list to remove the breakdown.
---@alias whop.invoices.UpdateInvoiceRequestLineItemsList whop.invoices.UpdateInvoiceRequestLineItemsItem[]

---Updated plan attributes.
---@class whop.invoices.UpdateInvoiceRequestPlan
---@field adaptive_pricing_enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Whether this plan accepts local currency payments via adaptive pricing.
---@field billing_period? number|distilled.Null The interval in days at which the plan charges (renewal plans).
---@field currency? whop.invoices.LegacyCurrencies|string|distilled.Null The three-letter ISO currency code for the plan's pricing. Defaults to USD.
---@field custom_fields? whop.invoices.UpdateInvoiceRequestPlanCustomFieldsList|distilled.Null An array of custom field objects.
---@field description? string|distilled.Null The description of the plan.
---@field expiration_days? number|distilled.Null The number of days until the membership expires and revokes access (expiration plans). For example, 365 for a one-year access period.
---@field initial_price? number|distilled.Null An additional amount charged upon first purchase. Use only if a one time payment OR you want to charge an additional amount on top of the renewal price. Provided as a number in the specified currency. Eg: 10.43 for $10.43
---@field internal_notes? string|distilled.Null A personal description or notes section for the business.
---@field legacy_payment_method_controls? boolean|distilled.Null Whether this plan uses legacy payment method controls
---@field payment_method_configuration? whop.invoices.UpdateInvoiceRequestPlanPaymentMethodConfiguration|distilled.Null The explicit payment method configuration for the plan. If not provided, the platform or company's defaults will apply.
---@field plan_type? whop.invoices.PlanTypes|string|distilled.Null Indicates if the plan is a one time payment or recurring.
---@field release_method? whop.invoices.ReleaseMethod|string|distilled.Null This is the release method the business uses to sell this plan.
---@field renewal_price? number|distilled.Null The amount the customer is charged every billing period. Use only if a recurring payment. Provided as a number in the specified currency. Eg: 10.43 for $10.43
---@field stock? number|distilled.Null The number of units available for purchase.
---@field trial_period_days? number|distilled.Null The number of free trial days added before a renewal plan.
---@field unlimited_stock? boolean|distilled.Null When true, the plan has unlimited stock (stock field is ignored). When false, purchases are limited by the stock field.
---@field visibility? whop.invoices.Visibility|string|distilled.Null Shows or hides the plan from public/business view.

